    {"kind": "capture", "evidence": "p12.pcap t=546232..546321 (2014-03-31), battle 'Frostfang Growlers': one Howler on arrival, then waves of 6, 9, 10 and 11 (the last with the Frostfang Alpha) 7.4 s after arrival and 15.4, 15.9 and 16.9 s apart; every Growler, Prowler and Howler 760 health, the Alpha 3,800 at scale 1.7; names 104067, 116023, 115837, 423045 and models 176 and 177; the Exit door (name 4826, model 846) right after the last kill; packet 62 at t=546240.0 with 500.0, 1, 100000, 500, 300, 25000, 5000."},
