    {"kind": "reconstructed", "evidence": "(R) The arena (the clearing every battle uses today, not the captured one), the arrival, ring and door positions, the wave trigger (one left, or 16 to 17 s after the wave before), the 10 knockouts, the reward, and definition 0 for the Prowler, Howler and Alpha, which no quest names. Health and damage follow rank and tier, which give the captured 760 and 3,800. The starter is not placed: `entry.starter` is the design's unverified Snowhill spot and `battle_row` stays false until a row with a checked position exists in field_battles.json."},
    {"kind": "reconstructed", "evidence": "(R) rc-0137 prize wheel (2026-11-12): 'Frostfang Growlers' has no wheel on the wiki, no shipped dungeon record and no item page that names its prize wheel, so it spins the wheel of 'Frostfang Snarlers!' (fandom revision 48736), the battle of difficulty 1 nearest its own 1, and 2 coins."}
